      "example": "During glacial periods, when large amounts of water are locked up in ice sheets, the ratio of oxygen-18 to oxygen-16 in seawater decreases.",
      "species_response": "The study has highlighted the importance of considering the species-specific response of foraminifera to environmental changes.",
      "complexity": "This interplay between different factors makes the interpretation of isotopic records a sophisticated task that requires a deep understanding of both the biological and physical processes at work."
